"RetroPlug v0.8.0\n\nusage: retroplug-cli <command> [args...]\n       retroplug-cli <session.js> [args...]   (run a JavaScript session file by path)\n\ncommands:\n  test             Strip and run a directory of TypeScript test files\n  run              Strip and run a single TypeScript session file\n  render           Render a ROM/SAV to a WAV file (full mix or per-channel stems)\n  lsdj-rom         inspect / extract / metadata-patch LSDj ROM kits, palettes and fonts\n  risa-rom         inspect / extract / metadata-patch risa ROM kits, themes and fonts\n  bliptoaster-rom  inspect / extract / edit BlipToaster ROM kits, theme and font (+ compile WAV \u2192 .rkit)\n  n8-load          load + boot a ROM on a physical Everdrive N8 Pro over USB (menu-driven)\n  n8-bridge        stream live MIDI to a physical Everdrive N8 Pro over USB\n  n8-sync          drive risa host-sync on a physical Everdrive N8 Pro from a MIDI clock\n  n8-play          play a scripted MIDI sequence on a physical Everdrive N8 Pro (no MIDI hardware needed)\n  analyze-capture  measure a hardware audio capture: level, pitch, envelope swing, band energy\n  grab-frame       grab one NES video frame off the USB capture card as a PNG (warm-up frames discarded)\n  launchpad-probe  drive a real Novation Launchpad and report what it sends back\n\nRun 'retroplug-cli <command> --help' for a command's options."
